  "description": "36 Castlewood Road, 2nd- Section 73",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;docs-internal-guid-7a91cd8d-7fff-1500-f562-41437b51117c&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot; style=&quot;line-height:1.38;text-align: justify;background-color:#ffffff;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;The proposed variation of&amp;nbsp; Condition 1 (approved drawings) to allow for an increase in the size of the upper ground floor and first floor rear extensions is considered to result in an unacceptable overbearing impact to neighbouring properties. The proposal is therefore contrary to Policy LP2 of the LP33, the London Plan and the NPPF 2024.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;",
    "&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Arial, sans-serif; text-align: justify; white-space-collapse: preserve; font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;The proposed variation of&amp;nbsp; Condition 1 (approved drawings) to allow for an increase in the size of the upper ground floor and first floor rear extensions is considered to result in &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; white-space-collapse: preserve; text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;an overly dominant and visually intrusive form of development that would detract from the character and appearance of the host property and the wider terrace contrary to Policies D1, D3 and D4 of the London Plan, Policy LP1 of the Hackney Local Plan, and the REA SPD 2025.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;"
  ],
